{"2781680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Stickman", "steam_appid": 2781680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/a1f2202a7578bfce5fb2ff691a6f2988.avif?t=1783277808\" width=1430 height=452 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/a5eb75ba44af53c01f4bf8bd8b7e69f8.avif?t=1783277808\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a fun-to-use movement system with double jumps, sliding, wall running, and a grappling hook, on top of changing level mechanics that can variate the movement!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/c97697aba5548a0ae65254abbd91b9dd.poster.avif?t=1783277808\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/c97697aba5548a0ae65254abbd91b9dd.webm?t=1783277808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/c97697aba5548a0ae65254abbd91b9dd.mp4?t=1783277808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/90a9df76901f3ae2b4a4f7294233a943.avif?t=1783277808\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a variety of weapons, grenades, and abilities to defeat the Erasers and climb the leaderboards in PvE! Also, try out PvEvP, where you can fight against The Erasers and your StickFriends at the same time! Or race your friends on any level to see who's the king of speed!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/d647a402c0ee9830ba6b7f5351f02c75.poster.avif?t=1783277808\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/d647a402c0ee9830ba6b7f5351f02c75.webm?t=1783277808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/d647a402c0ee9830ba6b7f5351f02c75.mp4?t=1783277808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/37f77a4a486e5ec569a78ea3b2fd80da.avif?t=1783277808\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with many PvE levels, there's a variety of PvP options. Fight against your Stickfriends and Stick it to 'em!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/30f2fa4e746ed21191b19dd00b2129cf.poster.avif?t=1783277808\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/30f2fa4e746ed21191b19dd00b2129cf.webm?t=1783277808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/30f2fa4e746ed21191b19dd00b2129cf.mp4?t=1783277808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/fd7fa975f72f41f020a2ae15b59b3264.avif?t=1783277808\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw a skin for your Stickman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw a picture that you can place anywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the colors of all the weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on a nice hat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And More!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/5142aea78ae79aed63281fcadb70533b.poster.avif?t=1783277808\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/5142aea78ae79aed63281fcadb70533b.webm?t=1783277808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/5142aea78ae79aed63281fcadb70533b.mp4?t=1783277808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/0aa0995da2f2781960cff9fe192ca83e.avif?t=1783277808\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build levels with a built-in level editor! Then you can share those levels with friends and battle it out in PvP or race!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/aef4c6fde454f2a0b253d96b5a814103.poster.avif?t=1783277808\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/aef4c6fde454f2a0b253d96b5a814103.webm?t=1783277808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/aef4c6fde454f2a0b253d96b5a814103.mp4?t=1783277808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/07cce892da439b24c3b7296f7ac87849.avif?t=1783277808\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly, have fun! Because that's why we play video games in the first place.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/a5eb75ba44af53c01f4bf8bd8b7e69f8.avif?t=1783277808\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a fun-to-use movement system with double jumps, sliding, wall running, and a grappling hook, on top of changing level mechanics that can variate the movement!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/c97697aba5548a0ae65254abbd91b9dd.poster.avif?t=1783277808\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/c97697aba5548a0ae65254abbd91b9dd.webm?t=1783277808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/c97697aba5548a0ae65254abbd91b9dd.mp4?t=1783277808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/90a9df76901f3ae2b4a4f7294233a943.avif?t=1783277808\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a variety of weapons, grenades, and abilities to defeat the Erasers and climb the leaderboards in PvE! Also, try out PvEvP, where you can fight against The Erasers and your StickFriends at the same time! Or race your friends on any level to see who's the king of speed!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/d647a402c0ee9830ba6b7f5351f02c75.poster.avif?t=1783277808\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/d647a402c0ee9830ba6b7f5351f02c75.webm?t=1783277808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/d647a402c0ee9830ba6b7f5351f02c75.mp4?t=1783277808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/37f77a4a486e5ec569a78ea3b2fd80da.avif?t=1783277808\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with many PvE levels, there's a variety of PvP options. Fight against your Stickfriends and Stick it to 'em!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/30f2fa4e746ed21191b19dd00b2129cf.poster.avif?t=1783277808\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/30f2fa4e746ed21191b19dd00b2129cf.webm?t=1783277808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/30f2fa4e746ed21191b19dd00b2129cf.mp4?t=1783277808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/fd7fa975f72f41f020a2ae15b59b3264.avif?t=1783277808\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw a skin for your Stickman</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw a picture that you can place anywhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the colors of all the weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on a nice hat</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And More!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/5142aea78ae79aed63281fcadb70533b.poster.avif?t=1783277808\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/5142aea78ae79aed63281fcadb70533b.webm?t=1783277808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/5142aea78ae79aed63281fcadb70533b.mp4?t=1783277808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/0aa0995da2f2781960cff9fe192ca83e.avif?t=1783277808\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build levels with a built-in level editor! Then you can share those levels with friends and battle it out in PvP or race!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/aef4c6fde454f2a0b253d96b5a814103.poster.avif?t=1783277808\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/aef4c6fde454f2a0b253d96b5a814103.webm?t=1783277808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/aef4c6fde454f2a0b253d96b5a814103.mp4?t=1783277808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/extras/07cce892da439b24c3b7296f7ac87849.avif?t=1783277808\" width=572 height=74 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And most importantly, have fun! Because that's why we play video games in the first place.</p>", "short_description": "The Stickman is a movement-based FPS inspired by Titanfall 2 and Trackmania! Climb the leaderboards in PvE time trials, battle friends in PvP, or create custom stages with the built-in Level Editor and style your Stickman with numerous customization options!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/9f7e1afa10554c80482ccca234a22d165e8221fe/header.jpg?t=1783277808", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/ca341e8dde0766eb71e1dc1598f96f03f6bef537/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783277808", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2781680/ca341e8dde0766eb71e1dc1598f96f03f6bef537/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783277808", "website": "https://thestickmangame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 3600X/Intel Core i5-9600K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1080/RX 5700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 720p 60fps on all low settings</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 5600/Intel Core i5-12400F<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 3060/RX 66